ted soaker tub and separate shower), home office/den, main bath, storage room, and a generous laundry room with direct garage access.  The finished basement adds a large rec room, 2 bedrooms, perfect for family/guests, a full bath, a gym/office area, and ample storage. Freshly painted, with central A/C, an oversized heated double garage, and ravine trails nearby. Welcome Home! (id:67522)","facts":[["Price","$549,900"],["Type","Townhouse"],["Style","Bungalow"],["Bedrooms","3"],["Bathrooms","3"],["Living area","1,776 sq ft"],["Year built","1998"],["Storeys","1"],["Condo fee","$429 monthly"],["Neighbourhood","Bulyea Heights"],["Town","Edmonton"],["Postal code","T6R2S3"],["MLS® number","E4513538"],["Listed","October 19, 2026"]],"features":[["Appliances","Washer, Refrigerator, Dishwasher, Stove, Dryer, Alarm System, Microwave Range Hood Combo, Window Coverings, Garage door opener"],["Heating","Forced air"],["Cooling","Central air conditioning"],["Fireplace","Gas"],["Basement","Finished, Full"],["Parking","Attached Garage"],["Condo fee includes","Property Management, Insurance, Other, See Remarks"]],"rooms":[["Living room","Main level",""],["Dining room","Main level",""],["Kitchen","Main level",""],["Family room","Main level",""],["Den","Main level",""],["Primary Bedroom","Main level",""],["Bedroom 2","Basement",""],["Bedroom 3","Basement",""]],"courtesy":"Wendy Gallagher, Exp Realty","board":"REALTORS® Association of Edmonton","town_slug":"edmonton","hood_slug":"bulyea-heights","area":"southwest-edmonton"}